umbrawg-tools (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Rust-based package built from the Cargo workspace.
  * Ship uwg and uwg-quick with addconf, syncconf, and advanced-security.
  * Install man pages, bash/zsh/fish completions, and systemd units.
  * Replace the legacy C packaging with a cargo build.

